{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>For Elohim has heard the voice of the lad where he is.</b> That is to say: in that very place where he is, I will give him water to drink before he departs from the place. And our Rabbis of blessed memory interpreted: a person is judged only according to his deeds at that hour, as it is said: <b>אל קול הנער באשר הוא שם</b> — 'to the voice of the lad where he is.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:13:56.898693571Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}